    "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Access</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Game is\u00a0 now V1.0. A Better Translation is now available\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for your support!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Inkbrush &amp; Blade \u2014 A Journey Through Mystic China</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>When spirits roam and legends come alive, only a true cultivator can restore balance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a lone Yao Hunter, wield blade and spell to cleanse a world where ancient demons awaken and forgotten myths take shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a hand-painted realm inspired by Chinese folklore \u2014 a living scroll of monsters, miracles, and martial arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every choice writes a legend. Every battle bends fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose Your Path: Become a Legendary Yao Hunter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mo San</strong> \u2013 A warrior from the\u00a0 Yao-Slaying Bureau, carrying a cursed blade thirsts\u00a0 blood. <br>He channels his rage into raw power \u2014 but with every cut, the blade hungers more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How long before it devours him whole?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915510/extras/8ad97d51b80189292064928c5d20f450.poster.avif?t=1753897431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915510/extras/8ad97d51b80189292064928c5d20f450.webm?t=1753897431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chuan</strong> \u2013 A Taoist with a bamboo-fire sword and a pouch full of dangerous inventions. <br>He may look frail, but his bullets are blessed with talismanic magic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">His homemade weapons\u00a0 &quot;Bamboo Bombard&quot; \u2014 turn spiritual alchemy into explosive justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915510/extras/7decfc32ec92619e9ea030a5bde6ac6f.poster.avif?t=1753897431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915510/extras/7decfc32ec92619e9ea030a5bde6ac6f.webm?t=1753897431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A-Zi</strong> \u2013 A prodigy witch from the southern Miao tribes, bonded with the poisons of the wild.<br>She commands a legion of venomous insects and conjures ancient hexes passed down through bloodlines. To fight her is to fight the jungle itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915510/extras/10850521cfe661ed39fe26ab987098e7.poster.avif?t=1753897431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915510/extras/10850521cfe661ed39fe26ab987098e7.webm?t=1753897431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ao Yu</strong> \u2013 A young dragon-descendant learning to command the storm.<br>With mastery over wind, fire, thunder, and rain, she dances on the edge of control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But when her human form shatters... the dragon within awakens.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915510/extras/ad713ab1df0fe6a446f4907abe5506dd.poster.avif?t=1753897431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915510/extras/ad713ab1df0fe6a446f4907abe5506dd.webm?t=1753897431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>A Martial Fantasy Roguelike Rooted in Eastern Lore</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">400+ Handcrafted Cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">172 Inner Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">54 Mystical Elixirs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ Random Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ Unique Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Ascending Difficulty Levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Modes of Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Yao Hunt Tournament</strong> \u2013 Team up with friends and race to cleanse the land</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Yao-Hunter\u2019s Edict</strong> \u2013 Daily global challenges with ranked leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Custom Mode</strong> \u2013 Tailor your adventure with custom seeds and rules</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Steam Workshop Now Available!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the <strong>[Experimental Features \u2192 Workshop]</strong> menu to install community mods and create your own martial myths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Official Discord:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Inkbrush &amp; Blade \u2014 A Journey Through Mystic China</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>When spirits roam and legends come alive, only a true cultivator can restore balance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a lone Yao Hunter, wield blade and spell to cleanse a world where ancient demons awaken and forgotten myths take shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a hand-painted realm inspired by Chinese folklore \u2014 a living scroll of monsters, miracles, and martial arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every choice writes a legend. Every battle bends fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose Your Path: Become a Legendary Yao Hunter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mo San</strong> \u2013 A warrior from the\u00a0 Yao-Slaying Bureau, carrying a cursed blade thirsts\u00a0 blood. <br>He channels his rage into raw power \u2014 but with every cut, the blade hungers more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How long before it devours him whole?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915510/extras/8ad97d51b80189292064928c5d20f450.poster.avif?t=1753897431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915510/extras/8ad97d51b80189292064928c5d20f450.webm?t=1753897431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chuan</strong> \u2013 A Taoist with a bamboo-fire sword and a pouch full of dangerous inventions. <br>He may look frail, but his bullets are blessed with talismanic magic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">His homemade weapons\u00a0 &quot;Bamboo Bombard&quot; \u2014 turn spiritual alchemy into explosive justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autop