e</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">400+ Handcrafted Cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">172 Inner Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">54 Mystical Elixirs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ Random Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ Unique Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Ascending Difficulty Levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Modes of Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Yao Hunt Tournament</strong> \u2013 Team up with friends and race to cleanse the land</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Yao-Hunter\u2019s Edict</strong> \u2013 Daily global challenges with ranked leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Custom Mode</strong> \u2013 Tailor your adventure with custom seeds and rules</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Steam Workshop Now Available!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the <strong>[Experimental Features \u2192 Workshop]</strong> menu to install community mods and create your own martial myths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Official Discord:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Yao-Guai Hunter is a Wuxia roguelike deck-building game. In a world where Yao-Guai roam free, player battles with various evil beings, collecting cards and learn inner skills. Encountering various adventures in the martial world.",
    "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cYao-Guai Hunter is an easy recommendation for fans of deckbuilding roguelikes. If you're into mythical creatures and Chinese folklore, that's just icing on the cake.\u201d<br>\u8001\u5b9e\u4eba\u8bc4\u6d4b\u7ec4<br><br>\u201cIn a deckbuilding roguelike market that's overflowing with competition, Yao-Guai Hunter stands out with its three distinct playable characters, layered with Inner Skills and Elixirs to deliver a deep and thoughtfully crafted deckbuilding experience.\u201d<br>\u4e2d\u56fd\u9274\u8d4f\u5bb6\u540c\u597d\u4f1a<br>",
